\ Not supported yet (plan row S3, slice S3a-ops C1), against all of Init
\ (check.py --init): the keys of Nat.decidable_dvd, whose type is a
\ DecidableRel, hold the application (fun a b => a ∣ b) ?a ?b, and
\ ignoreArg's isProof needs inferType of an application whose head is a
\ lambda, which src/front/infer.fs does not port yet (plan FE1c), so the
\ instance stays unverified and decide on a divisibility answers error
\ 93, exit 2, never a verdict.
\ Lean: theorem x_dc_dvd : 3 ∣ 12 := by decide
theorem x_dc_dvd
  3 12 Dvd.dvd
:= by
  by-decide
end x_dc_dvd
